  "notes": "ISIS-K is a province of the Islamic State (relation isis +90) and an enemy of the al-Qaeda network and of the Taliban (afg_taliban, an others-bloc faction). It is UN-listed and US-designated. Its mass-casualty attacks (Kabul airport 2021, Kerman 2024, Crocus City Hall 2024) belong only in briefing text. Status 2026: weakened inside Afghanistan by Taliban operations but still active, with networks in Pakistan and Central Asian recruitment per UN monitoring; Taliban claimed strikes on ISKP sites in Pakistan in June 2026 (denied by Pakistan). Game framing: early-game cell enemy in afghan_highlands, often a three-way encounter with Taliban units. Captured Humvees as rare set-piece vehicles are Captain-confirmed (2026-10-10).",
